app console

# The compiler's own parser as a --obj image. zenith links this object into
# itself and talks to it through parseRun/parseErr*/parseOut*/parseRelease
# (plus the one-shot zenith_obj_init), instead of spawning a separate parser.
# parseRun lexes, parses, lowers and serializes the whole program to the ZAST
# side buffer; src/parseembed.cpp then loads that ZAST into a C++ Program.
use parser
